usage: rebis.pipeline [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.pipeline — Imscription Pipeline & Frobenius Verification

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    verify              Run Frobenius verification across all pipeline modules
    imscribe            Run auto-imscription on a named system
    retro               Run retrosynthetic analysis
    therapy             Run therapy→PDB pipeline for a single therapy
    therapy-all         Run therapy→PDB pipeline for ALL therapies
    lift                Lift prose — apply the human-lift protocol to a file
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
